<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FALL ACROSS THE BOARD.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FALL ACROSS THE BOARD.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates fell at</p>
<p>the Bank of Finland's daily fixing, following a 10 basis point</p>
<p>tender rate cut to 3.10 pct early on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				     Sept 18 fix	    Sept 17 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.11 pct		3.24 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.15 pct		3.26 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.20 pct		3.29 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.36 pct		3.45 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.47 pct		3.57 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.58 pct		3.69 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
